ulation of this application does not guarantee the design, size, range of motion, etc. of the actual robot.\nWhen actually installing a robot, please check the specifications on the product page.\n- Please be careful of your surroundings when using this app.", "short_description": "You can place OVR series virtual robots in real space and simulate operation.\nThe OVR series is a robot sold by Oriental Motor."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1594860848028062", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75210390_1594860854694728_1273340538204967659_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KJgxyjQwLiwQ7kNvwGQiW8-&_nc_oc=AdoPngSORjgs_7XLyCGLH7lu4edx_IMhZ1cnQj0Oe6Re_sqKgkwxlACL6VH8w55sDa8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQ1eO5oxE1UDRIPz4chfYCxo2_82vVZJsArKBcHdwg88w&oe=6B01E596"}, {"file_name": "CoverArtLandscapeMini.png", "id": "858590429630683", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974810_858590432964016_3799015126354441121_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=BN4hSPrzUl0Q7kNvwH2c9Lm&_nc_oc=AdpKGvfNgS2JKT6RuIDnE3ToBG_zORtsoKKWQ0D3BZDNxAiSbbnTGtaGbOrqgPRjWIQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQSumMJTI2CXuYOFPhiY3QjDqshIcrlIxCrPpwlzzyVhQ&oe=6B01E91C"}, {"file_name": "CoverArtLandscape.png", "id": "495376463065176", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974810_495376466398509_7417159219708782199_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=v2HtBwRYlmwQ7kNvwF_Wwab&_nc_oc=Adp-RIqv-VOZ0A51JaiXrNGXspmGjU9_0roofzSSjpUtFbcMk9fTiOCQ1tqIYDhsvEA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQT8LokrbBBkU2V64zJCxxuJ3NwX-6Bzl45efDsPrT9mlQ&oe=6B01CA5B"}, {"file_name": "CoverArtPortrait.png", "id": "486